One class per capability, each declaring

* ``FIELDS``       the fields a caller may send, in order;
* ``CONSTRAINTS``  per field: ``required``, ``allowed_values``, ``min``/``max``,
  ``format`` and the declared ``type``. A vocabulary a route enforces is
